{"id":"93ac52576650a3d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC CI Localization Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Localization Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Localization Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Localization Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset\">58-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\">\\(h,f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in{}^\\omega[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in{}^\\omega[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal S\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}=\\{\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}=\\{\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{a\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}\">\\([\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{a\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{loc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land h:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(1\\leq h(n))\\land \\mathfrak{loc}=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal{S}|:\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathcal{S}\\;\\left(s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|s(n)|\\leq h(n))\\land\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{loc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land h:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(1\\leq h(n))\\land \\mathfrak{loc}=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal{S}|:\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathcal{S}\\;\\left(s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|s(n)|\\leq h(n))\\land\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The width bound is global for every slalom coordinate; only capture of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is eventual. The finite-subset source is the relevant dependency, not ring localization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"h,f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in{}^\\omega[\\omega]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Card}=\\{\\kappa:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega]^{<\\omega}=\\{a\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{loc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{loc}\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land h:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(1\\leq h(n))\\land \\mathfrak{loc}=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal{S}|:\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{<\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathcal{S}\\;\\left(s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|s(n)|\\leq h(n))\\land\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))\\right)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1614","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-ci-localization-cardinal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","130f2eb9510d97cd"]}